 "remarks": "This storybook cape with front porch is set on nearly one third of an acre and is conveniently located to everything! Shopping, schools, restaurants, gyms, train, highway, library and hospital. Main floor offers a large living room with wood burning fireplace, dining room, kitchen and updated full bath. Hardwood floors and newer windows throughout. The expanded second floor provides three bedrooms with wide plank wood flooring and a remodeled full bath. There is a walk up attic for easy access to an abundance of storage. The finished basement offers a tremendous amount of additional living space. In addtion to great curb appeal the exterior has a large yard with dog fence, a back porch, shed, garage and a 7 year old roof. The 200 amp electrical service can support any future home upgrades.",
